{
  "title": "6W6",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "TR-606 style drum",
        "machine. Every",
        "voice synthesized,",
        "no samples - kick,",
        "snare, toms, hats,",
        "cymbal, plus a clap.",
        "Fitted to a real 606.",
        "",
        "Reverb and delay",
        "sends on every voice,",
        "7 distortion types,",
        "master glue Comp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing",
      "lines": [
        "Pads (left 4x4):",
        " row1: BD SD LT HT",
        " row2: CH OH CY CP",
        " pad 9:  Master",
        " pad10:  Reverb",
        " pad11:  Delay",
        "",
        "Shift+Pad: select",
        " without sounding.",
        "Mute+Pad: mute that",
        " drum ([M] in bar)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Editing",
      "lines": [
        "Knobs 1-8 edit the",
        "visible page.",
        "Jog: change page.",
        "Jog CLICK on Main:",
        " lock the page so",
        " pads stop moving",
        " it ([L] in bar).",
        "",
        "Every voice: Tune,",
        "Decay, Drive, Dist,",
        "Level, Rev, Dly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Hats",
      "lines": [
        "Choke (Cl Hat page",
        "and Master):",
        " Off - hats ring",
        "  over each other",
        " CH > OH - closed",
        "  cuts open (606)",
        " Mutual - either",
        "  cuts the other"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Send FX",
      "lines": [
        "Rev and Dly on every",
        "voice are SENDS: turn",
        "them up, then set the",
        "bus on pads 10 / 11.",
        "",
        "Delay Time is a note",
        "division and follows",
        "the host tempo, so it",
        "stays in time when",
        "you change BPM.",
        "",
        "Both are silent at",
        "zero - the kit is",
        "untouched until you",
        "send something."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencing",
      "lines": [
        "Use Move's own",
        "sequencer: drum",
        "track with a kit,",
        "mute it (HiJack),",
        "set track MIDI OUT",
        "to the slot channel.",
        "Each drum = one",
        "lane. Note map:",
        "drum rack 36-43",
        "(or GM, switchable)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Remote UI",
      "lines": [
        "Full panel in the",
        "browser, on port",
        "7700 of whatever",
        "address the Move is",
        "on:",
        " move.local:7700",
        " (WiFi, if mDNS",
        "  is behaving)",
        " 172.16.254.1:7700",
        " (USB-C, always",
        "  this address)",
        "then /remote-ui.",
        "",
        "The panel follows",
        "the pad you hit."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
